.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# The CONTENTS of outputs/, not the directory: git cannot re-include anything
# inside an excluded directory, so `outputs/` followed by a negation silently
# does nothing. Working runs stay out; one finished run is published on purpose.
#
# The owner asked to see what a user would see before installing anything, and
# until 2026-09-01 nothing here answered that -- outputs/ was empty AND ignored.
# This one is verbatim output, regenerable with
# `python3 examples/uk_food_beverage.py`.
outputs/*
!outputs/uk_food_beverage/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Scratch fixtures the validators write and delete. Tracked by accident until
# 2026-08-26, so every run of check.sh left six binary diffs in the tree.
outputs/_scratch/

# Excel's lock files. It writes `~$name.xlsx` beside a workbook while the
# workbook is open and usually removes it on close, but not after a crash or a
# force quit. This repository is mostly xlsx published by statistical offices
# and the owner opens them, so these appear next to tracked data and read as
# something to commit. One turned up in `data/ine/` on 2026-09-06.
~$*

# The MRIO workbooks a reader downloads to reproduce anything computed on the
# European system. `data/mrio/README.md` and the paper both say to put
# MRIO_2018_272regions.xlsx, Final_demand_2018.xlsx and TAXSUB_VA_2018.xlsx in
# this folder; that is 33 MB of somebody else's archive, and without these
# lines `git status` invites them into a commit. Ignored BEFORE the first
# download rather than after, which is the only order that works.
#
# The private tree has carried these since it first fetched the archive. This
# one did not, which nobody noticed until 2026-09-06, when the six validators
# that read the workbook shipped and the instructions to download it followed.
#
# Single `*` does not cross a directory separator, so `data/mrio/truth/` -- the
# tracked 844 kB validation set, which holds .xlsx of its own -- is untouched.
data/mrio/*.zip
data/mrio/*.xlsx
data/mrio/*.xlsb
data/mrio/*.ods
data/mrio/*.npz
data/mrio/raw/
